1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Returning to an AI coding task?
Start with three records:

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
the source revision, the changed artifact
and the actual checks.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The source revision identifies
the starting code. Keep it with the task

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
so the next person can inspect
the same starting point.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The artifact shows the proposed change.
If its content changes after review,

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
ask for a fresh review
of that exact version.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The check receipt records what ran
and where. Keep failed or blocked

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
checks visible, with the unfinished task
and its checkpoint.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
These records support a review decision.
A deployed service, connected account

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
or delivered post still needs
its own evidence and authorization.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Before your next handoff, name one task,
pin its starting revision

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
and keep the artifact, checks
and remaining gap together.
